<http://shaclshapes.org/PoliticianShape> a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:property [ sh:class <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/MilitaryUnit> ;
            sh:path <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/militaryUnit> ],
